1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,020
Woman: I heard you're planning a trip to Sky-High Ski Resort this winter

2
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:06,090
Have you booked everything yet?

3
00:00:06,090 --> 00:00:08,500
Man: Well, I've booked the cabin to stay

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,260
but I still need to reserve skis and ski boots.

5
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:13,210
Woman: You don't have your own?

6
00:00:13,210 --> 00:00:19,030
Man: No, this will actually be my first time skiing. I'm a bit nervous.

7
00:00:19,030 --> 00:00:20,592
Woman: You'll do fine.

8
00:00:20,592 --> 00:00:24,360
By the way, there's a great Thai restaurant next to the resort

9
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:27,150
and I don't think it requires reservations.

10
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:29,230
Man: Great! What's the name?

11
00:00:29,230 --> 00:00:33,070
Woman: Can't remember off the top of my head. Let me look it up on my phone.
